{{> page-header eyebrow="Affiliate Portal" heading="Marketing Resources" subheading="Everything you need to promote Animalife to your network."}}

<section class="section grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[240px_1fr]">
  {{> affiliate-portal-sidebar}}

  <div>
    <div class="card p-6">
      <p class="field-label">Your Personalized Shop Link</p>
      <div class="mt-2 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
        <input type="text" readonly value="{{shopLink}}" onclick="this.select()" class="input-field flex-1 text-sm" />
        <button type="button" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText('{{shopLink}}'); this.textContent='Copied!'" class="btn-outline !px-4 text-sm whitespace-nowrap">Copy Link</button>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-al-ink/55">Use this instead of your homepage link when promoting a specific product category &mdash; referrals are still credited to you.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-al-navy">Logo Assets</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="card p-6">
          <img src="/images/brand/animalife-logo.png" alt="Animalife USA logo" class="h-12" />
          <a href="/images/brand/animalife-logo.png" download class="mt-4 block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-al-navy hover:underline">Download (dark)</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card bg-al-navy p-6">
          <img src="/images/brand/animalife-logo-light.png" alt="Animalife USA logo, light" class="h-12" />
          <a href="/images/brand/animalife-logo-light.png" download class="mt-4 block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-white hover:underline">Download (light)</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-al-navy">Product Images</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="card p-6 text-center">
          <img src="/images/products/vetroflex-tub.png" alt="VetroFlex" class="mx-auto h-32 object-contain" />
          <p class="font-display mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-al-navy">VetroFlex</p>
          <a href="/images/products/vetroflex-tub.png" download class="mt-1 block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-al-navy/60 hover:underline">Download</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6 text-center">
          <img src="/images/products/vetrofen-tub.png" alt="VetroFen" class="mx-auto h-32 object-contain" />
          <p class="font-display mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-al-navy">VetroFen</p>
          <a href="/images/products/vetrofen-tub.png" download class="mt-1 block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-al-navy/60 hover:underline">Download</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6 text-center">
          <img src="/images/products/vetrofit-syringe.png" alt="VetroFit" class="mx-auto h-32 object-contain" />
          <p class="font-display mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-al-navy">VetroFit</p>
          <a href="/images/products/vetrofit-syringe.png" download class="mt-1 block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-al-navy/60 hover:underline">Download</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-al-navy">Sample Messaging</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 space-y-4">
        <div class="card p-6">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-al-ink/50">Social Caption</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-al-ink/80">I trust Animalife USA's root-cause, science-backed nutrition for the horses in my care &mdash; from joint support to recovery. Check them out: {{shopLink}}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-al-ink/50">Email / Newsletter Blurb</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-al-ink/80">I've partnered with Animalife USA because their formulations target the physiological root causes of equine performance and recovery, not just symptoms. If you're looking to support your horse's joints, inflammation response, or long-term wellness, I recommend taking a look: {{shopLink}}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
